      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "These innocuous, colorless drops can be poured directly into a victim's mouth, or slipped into their food or drink. They initially haze a victim's mind slightly, making them easier to fool; in later stages, they can lead to the victim entering a murderous "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "6f53a234-670f-5b02-a986-7cce57585fc8"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " state. Secret societies use these drops to befuddle a target or to frame them for violence."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Saving Throw",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:fortitude",
            "dc": 18
          }
        ]
      },
