  {
    "id": "6bcf0c74-00a9-5a35-ba4d-1db91ad3dab4",
    "pack": "dark-archive-remastered",
    "kind": "consumable",
    "slug": "consumable:gift-of-the-poisoned-heart",
    "name": "Gift of the Poisoned Heart",
    "level": 16,
    "rarity": "rare",
    "traits": ["consumable", "cursed", "magical", "unholy"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "dark-archive-remastered",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4141"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " 1 minute (concentrate, manipulate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Those who fail to see the curse view this object as a priceless gift, capable of restoring life to the deceased, but deep in the heart of this diamond lies a single flaw: a fissured occlusion of sickly, tainted red. To activate the diamond, place it on the relatively intact body of a creature that died within the past year. The stone shatters, restoring the recipient to life with the effects of a successful "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "ffb89230-3939-5733-83a2-d20bbd4d33db"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " ritual, except there's no limit to the level of the creature that can be revived."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This gift of life comes with a terrible cost: the recipient believes you—and anyone else who aided in the resurrection—deliberately caused their death and revived them only in furtherance of some nefarious scheme. Having a proxy activate the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "gift of the poisoned heart",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is of no use, as the item's magic sniffs out all coconspirators and uses your attempt to avoid the drawback to feed the resurrected creature's paranoia."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "No amount of information or persuasion can alleviate this mistrust, as the cursed creature twists the facts endlessly to fit their delusion. Only magic such as "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "9495e90b-a69c-5eaf-a472-b6b536856f28"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " can neutralize this effect, and the subject resists any attempt to alter their beliefs by magic."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.CXCWF6jQQHKHFhpR"
    },
    "data": {
      "bulk": "negligible",
      "category": "other",
      "usage": {
        "type": "held",
        "hands": "one"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "2809f576-1ab2-50e7-b3ce-87f9e4300044",
    "pack": "dark-archive-remastered",
    "kind": "consumable",
    "slug": "consumable:mistranslators-draft",
