    "level": 9,
    "rarity": "rare",
    "traits": ["consumable", "cursed", "magical", "potion"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "dark-archive-remastered",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4143"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (manipulate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A pickled lizard's tongue, tied into a knot, floats in this oily potion. When you drink it, you can speak and understand all spoken (but not written) languages for 1 hour. However, if you attempt to translate any spoken language, your translation is always erroneous in a way likely to cause substantial confusion or anger, typically reducing the listener's attitude toward you by one step. You aren't aware of your error, and any attempt to correct the mistake only compounds it."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.DZHV8R2908H2cVWM"
    },
    "data": {
      "bulk": "light",
      "category": "potion",
      "usage": {
        "type": "held",
        "hands": "one"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "1f250baa-f4b1-5079-b83f-1e4d59a62dfa",
    "pack": "dark-archive-remastered",
    "kind": "consumable",
    "slug": "consumable:moonlit-ink",
    "name": "Moonlit Ink",
    "level": 2,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["alchemical", "consumable"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "dark-archive-remastered",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4123"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (manipulate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Access",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Member of a secret society"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This alchemical ink is applied to a stamping device, typically a wooden seal or chop commissioned by the secret society and costing 1 sp. When the seal is pressed to paper, the ink briefly shows up before fading into invisibility. The stamp can be revealed by exposing the stamped item to direct moonlight for 1 minute. A character checking a good or document marked by a moonlit ink stamp must succeed at a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "perception",
            "dc": 25
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " check to spot the stamp without exposure to moonlight. In addition to its use by secret societies for their secret books, papers, and messages, some smugglers use moonlit ink to mark their goods."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.QyEp8sN9mn36K5El"
    },
